{"resourceIdentifier":"3208","resourceName":"Wheatbelt Biodiversity Carbon Credit Project","description":"The Wheatbelt Biodiversity Carbon Credit Project (WBCC) (hereafter referred to as “the Project”) is a carbon sequestration project developed by Decarbonology Pty Ltd. The initial project area is 159.3ha and consists of over 320,000 plantings, with plantings taking place on cleared and degraded former pastoral farmland. This Project focusses on ecosystem restoration of the project site and the Wheatbelt of WA more broadly. It aims to support existing primary forest patches via afforestation of matrix areas between fragments to increase native habitat area, connectivity and ecosystem functions. Plantings will consist of a mix of over 20 native species local to the region.","location":{"latitude":-31.338981,"longitude":115.972188},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2022-09-08","endExclusive":"2022-10-09","endInclusive":"2022-10-08"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"3208"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Western Australia"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Decarbonology Pty Ltd"},{"type":"string","value":"WA, Australia"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"2205"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Agriculture Forestry and Other Land Use"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_SUBCATERGORY_NAMES","values":[{"type":"string","value":"ARR"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"AR-ACM0003"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_ACREAGE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"159 Hectares"}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Earthood Services Limited"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE","values":[{"type":"